WARNING NOTICE:
this document describes parts of LINLIB/VISI used as part of vash,
Visual Assistant shell.

The compilation procedure of VISI tools is part of the assembly of vash.

So, vash and linlib/visi share common config file ../BLD.cfg
which is controlled by the ../Makefile and the ../configure script.

Only short library documentation (mini-help) files are included
in this release.

Directories and files of LINLIB/VISI project:

  READ_ME   - this text
  doc/      - documentation mini-help files

  programs to be linked with LINLIB:

  ../vash    - assistant shell itself
  ../vhset   - video hardware setup on user taste
  ../vtest   - testing of LINLIB

  src/       - sources of runtime libraries and VISI tools

  visi/      - user interaction preprocessors

  The next directories are used internally for the assembly ../vash only:

  lib/      - runtime librries
  bin/      - framework utilities
  include/  - header files

